{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/pulls/84","id":4285525085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTWnCF87_b-xd","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/pull/84","diff_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/pull/84.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/pull/84.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/issues/84","number":84,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Installer: first-class ZCode target (MCP + skills)","user":{"login":"hsliuustc0106","id":222337142,"node_id":"U_kgDODUCYdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222337142?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106","html_url":"https://github.com/hsliuustc0106","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsliuustc0106/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #83\n\n## What\n\nAdds `zcode` as a fourth installer target, mirroring the Cursor path (config-file merge + skill copy, no CLI invocation):\n\n- **Detection**: `zcode` on PATH, or an existing `~/.zcode/` directory. `--agent zcode` also accepted explicitly.\n- **MCP**: merges `mcp.servers.infermatrix-copilot` (nested key, stdio, same `uvx --from ... infermatrix-copilot-mcp` command as every other target) into `~/.zcode/cli/config.json`. That file also holds ZCode hooks and plugin state, so the installer merges non-destructively and writes a timestamped `config.json.<ts>.bak` backup first — same contract as the Cursor installer. Invalid JSON aborts without touching the file.\n- **Skills**: copied to `~/.zcode/skills/` (user scope; `{{INFERMATRIX_COPILOT_ROOT}}` substituted as usual). ZCode invokes them as `/imreview`, `/imdesign`, `/imcifix`, `/imupdate` — same slash form as Claude Code / Cursor, so the restart hint now reads `Claude/Cursor/ZCode`.\n\n## Why\n\nInferMatrixCopilot's core artifacts are already ZCode-compatible (standard stdio MCP server + SKILL.md skills with name/description frontmatter); only the installer lacked the target, forcing manual config wiring.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `test/test_install_mcp_script.py`: 4 new tests — merge preserves unrelated keys (`plugins`, existing servers) and backs up; creates config when missing; invalid JSON raises `InstallError` and leaves the file unchanged; detection via `~/.zcode/` dir.\n- Full file passes (12/12); related suites (`test_imupdate_skill`, `test_skills_scope`, `test_packaged_runtime`) pass (19/19 total).\n- End-to-end: `install_mcp.py --agent zcode --config-root <tmp>` produces the expected nested config, all four skills, and `~/.infermatrix-copilot/.env`.\n\nDirect mode needs no API keys; Strict config is agent-independent and unchanged.","created_at":"2026-08-15T08:36:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T23:42:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"zuiho-kai","id":31877877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODc3ODc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31877877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuiho-kai","html_url":"https://github.com/zuiho-kai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuiho-kai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuiho-kai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuiho-kai/gists{/gist_id}","